# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Panther Mastery (193), Raptor Mastery (197), Nothing But The Truth (1372), The Gurubashi Legends of Old (95748),
# Locating the Lost City (95770, Kin'weelay's next legend: the cavern entrance under the Vile Reef, west of Grom'gol, on
# the way to the jungle stalkers; handed in with the trophy skulls). Its follow-up, The Drowned City (95775), is a dungeon.
# Excelsior (628, Drizzlik: the Elder Saltwater Crocolisk on the coast between Zul'Kunda and Grom'gol, optional).
# Left out: The Bloodsail Buccaneers (608), taken in forever/horde/40-50/06-azshara at 50.

step Fly to the Undercity
  only Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock
  zone Badlands
  tip Your level 40 training is in the Undercity: fly there from Kargath, train, and take the zeppelin from the towers outside the city to Grom'gol.
  goto 4.1,44.9 "Kargath flight master"
  fly "Undercity"
  zone Undercity

step Undercity trainers
  only Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock
  zone Undercity
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock

step Riding at 40
  only Undead,Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  when level>=40
  tip Riding needs level 40 and costs 100 gold; learning it gives you a mount. Each race learns it from its own race's trainer: yours is Velma Warnam in Brill, a short ride north of the zeppelin towers, with Zachariah Post's skeletal horses (20 gold each) beside her. Ride back to the towers for the Grom'gol zeppelin.
  train 4773 optional                   -- Velma Warnam, riding trainer
  note "Skeletal horses: Zachariah Post, beside Velma Warnam in Brill."

step Zeppelin to Grom'gol
  only Warrior,Paladin,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  goto 61.8,59.2 "Zeppelin to Grom'gol"

step Fly to Grom'gol
  only Hunter,Shaman,Druid
  zone Badlands
  goto 4.1,44.9 "Kargath flight master"
  fly "Grom'gol"
  zone Stranglethorn Vale

step Grom'gol Base Camp
  turnin 1240                           -- Kin'weelay
  accept 95748 npc 2519                 -- Kin'weelay: the legend lies in Zul'Kunda, where this guide goes for Gan'zulah

step Jungle Stalkers
  tip The Jungle Stalkers (40-41) hunt the coast south of Grom'gol. They are well above you: pull one at a time and rest between fights.
  collect 3863 quest 572

step Far Seer Mok'thardin
  turnin 572
  accept 571

step Fly to Booty Bay
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  goto 32.5,29.3 "Grom'gol flight master"
  fly "Booty Bay"

step Booty Bay
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  turnin 577                          -- Drizzlik: the Snapjaw skins gathered earlier; inside
  accept 628                          -- Drizzlik: the Elder Saltwater Crocolisk suns on the coast between Zul'Kunda and Grom'gol, later on this loop
  tip Gringer, the flight master, waits on Booty Bay's upper deck. The quest givers stand on the boardwalks around the harbour and in the inn.
  turnin 213                          -- Kebok
  turnin 1180                         -- Wharfmaster Lozgil, on the docks: Gazlowe's letter, if you carry it
  accept 1181
  accept 606                            -- "Sea Wolf" MacKinley, on the top floor
  turnin 1181                         -- Baron Revilgaz, on the balcony beside MacKinley
  turnin 669
  accept 621                          -- Inside
