step Zul'Kunda
  tip West of the expedition, the Bloodscalp chiefs Gan'zulah and Nezzliok stand together in the ruins of Zul'Kunda. Clear their guards first, then pull them. Stay on the Bloodscalps here until level 41: Speaking with Gan'zulah, at the cauldron next, sends you to Skullsplitters of 41-43.
  collect 3904 quest 584.1
  collect 2007 quest 95748.1 @23.0,12.0 map 1434 -- from the Fall of Gurubashi, in the ruins
  collect 3905 quest 584.2
  tip On the coast between Zul'Kunda and Grom'gol an Elder Saltwater Crocolisk (level 38 elite) shares the spawns of the ordinary crocolisks: kill it if it is up and take its skin for Drizzlik.
  collect 4105 quest 628.1 optional @29.3,22.3 map 1434 -- Elder Saltwater Crocolisk
  level 41                            -- grind on the Bloodscalps here: Speaking with Gan'zulah, at the cauldron next, sends you to Skullsplitters of 41-43

