step The Vile Reef
  when onquest 95770
  when !complete 95770
  tip Locating the Lost City: west of Grom'gol, swim out over the Vile Reef and dive to the cavern entrance in the reef; the quest completes as you find it. Leave the cavern for now: the jungle stalkers are south along the coast.
  goto 21.8,27.6 map 1434 "the Drowned City's entrance, underwater"

