step The Bloodsail ships
  tip Optional, and tough at 42: the scroll, Cortello's Riddle, lies on the decks of the three ships off the Wild Shore, crewed by pirates of 42-45 who come in pairs. Take it only if you can pull the crew to the rail one at a time, or with a friend; its chain runs on through the Swamp of Sorrows, Dustwallow Marsh and the Hinterlands.
  collect 4056 "Cortello's Riddle" optional
  accept 624 optional                   -- for a later stop in the Swamp of Sorrows

step Zanzil's camps
  tip North-east of Mistvale, Zanzil's followers camp in the jungle; every one of them can carry the mixture.
  collect 4016 quest 621.1

