# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Swamp of Sorrows

step Into the Swamp of Sorrows
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Follow the road east from Duskwood through Deadwind Pass into the swamp. Magtoor waits at the Harborage, the draenei camp just off the road where it comes in from Deadwind Pass.
  accept 1389                           -- Magtoor

step Stonard
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Head east to Stonard, in the reeds south of the road.
  accept 698                            -- Dar, inside
  accept 1430                           -- Dar, inside
  getfp "Stonard" npc 6026              -- Breyk
  turnin 1420                           -- Helgrum the Swift, upstairs
  accept 1424                           -- Fel'zerul, on the top floor

step Sawtooth crocolisks
  tip The crocolisks wallow in the pools around Galen's camp and south towards Stonard; about one in four drops a flank.
  collect 6169 quest 698.1

step Noboru the Cudgel
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Noboru wanders the clearing south-west of the Fallow Sanctuary; his cudgel starts a quest.
  kill 5477 @54.9,34.1
  collect 6196 "Noboru's Cudgel"
  accept 1392

step Draenethyst crystals
  tip Ride north-east to the Fallow Sanctuary. The crystals stand along the way up to Galen Goodward's cage.
  collect 6071 x6 quest 1389.1          -- Draenethyst Crystals

step Galen's Escape
  tip Galen Goodward is held in the Fallow Sanctuary in the swamp's north-east. Free him and follow him out, fighting off the swamp creatures that chase him.
  accept 1393
  complete 1393

step Galen's Strongbox
  tip His strongbox waits at his old camp north of Stonard, on the way back west.
  turnin 1393

step The Harborage
  tip Ride west along the road to the draenei camp at the Harborage, near the way in from Deadwind Pass. Lack of Surplus goes to Tok'Kar at Misty Reed Post on the next swamp visit: keep the flanks.
  turnin 1392                           -- Magtoor
  turnin 1389